:REM "This is file - DS4NA.SET - "
:REM "shipped by Tektronix with this mask on TTiP disk 3, and copied here unchanged apart from these notes"
:REM "a TDS 794D will refuse the IMPEDANCE line: its inputs are 50 ohm only and answer with a parameter error. Tektronix chose the 1 Mohm input, which is what TTiP used with an external terminator. On a 784D it is right, and the program reports the refusal on a 794D"
:REM "no UI line here, so Start measurement will start the hit counter and leave the timebase alone rather than rebuild the sweep as an eye"
:REM "Copyright 1993 Tektronix Inc."
:ACQUIRE:STATE STOP
:REM "Neither vertical scale nor offset are specified by this standard."
:CH1:COUPLING AC;IMPEDANCE MEG;BANDWIDTH FULL
:CH1:SCALE 1.0e-1;POSITION 0;OFFSET 0
:CH2:COUPLING AC;IMPEDANCE MEG;BANDWIDTH FULL
:CH2:SCALE 1.0e-1;POSITION 0;OFFSET 0
:DISPLAY:STYLE DOTS
:HORIZONTAL:MAIN:SECDIV  1.0e-09
:HORIZONTAL:RECORDLENGTH 500
:HORIZONTAL:POSITION 50
:HORIZONTAL:TRIGGER:POSITION 49
:TRIG:MAIN:MODE AUTO;TYPE EDGE;LEV 0;HOLDOFF:BY DEFAULT
:TRIG:MAIN:EDGE:SOU CH2;COUPLING AC;SLOPE RISE
:SELECT:CH1 ON
:CLEARM
:ACQUIRE:STATE RUN
:BELL
